# Report changed identifiers

When a change adds, renames, or removes UI/game selectors, include a short list in the reply:

- CSS classes (e.g. `.action-btn`, `.panel-court-name`)
- Element IDs (e.g. `#courtMeta`, `#eventsBtn`)
- Config/label keys that control visible copy (e.g. `GAME_CONFIG.labels.courtName`)

Only list what changed in that turn. Omit the section if nothing identifier-related changed.
